00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:04.830
I want to take the music major

272
00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:08.300
Not like those nerds
Ranking is more important than life

273
00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:11.190
At what time will the physical examination end?

274
00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:13.610
Is your mom coming to Parents Night tonight?

275
00:19:13.610 --> 00:19:15.100
No, I didn't tell her

276
00:19:15.100 --> 00:19:16.180
me too

277
00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:18.790
My parents are in Paris

278
00:19:18.790 --> 00:19:20.510
So I didn't tell them on purpose.

279
00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:21.900
Afraid of disturbing their work

280
00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:23.980
Lest they fly back all the way

281
00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:26.130
Bus to Cairo

282
00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:27.910
Please fasten your seat belt

283
00:19:32.260 --> 00:19:37.300
[J Medical Center Shuttle Bus]

284
00:19:58.540 --> 00:19:59.630
[Treatment Room Pharmacy Room]

285
00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:10.210
Please take off all clothes except underwear

286
00:20:10.210 --> 00:20:13.280
Change into examination clothes before coming out

287
00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:56.020
[Parents’ medical history]

288
00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:58.160
I have to take extra classes at night. I don’t want to feel groggy.

289
00:20:58.160 --> 00:20:59.760
I want to have a test without anesthesia

290
00:20:59.760 --> 00:21:02.150
Do you usually take any medicine?

291
00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:06.090
Do you have sexual experience?

292
00:21:06.090 --> 00:21:09.670
Pregnancy or miscarriage experience
Please also fill it in

293
00:21:09.670 --> 00:21:12.000
Doesn't this constitute an invasion of privacy?

294
00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:14.810
Why do we need to ask these questions during the physical examination?

295
00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:17.440
Are you still having trouble sleeping recently?

296
00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:19.170
Yes

297
00:21:32.700 --> 00:21:33.600
How

298
00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:35.400
did you do anything bad

299
00:21:46.900 --> 00:21:49.820
I have what you need most right now

300
00:21:49.820 --> 00:21:50.720
Do you want to come and get it?

301
00:22:00.190 --> 00:22:02.430
After passing the examination room, turn right

302
00:22:07.180 --> 00:22:10.370
Leave the physical examination area and go up to the lobby on the first floor.

303
00:22:21.460 --> 00:22:22.660
[pharmacy room]

304
00:22:21.470 --> 00:22:23.270
Go to the corridor to the pharmacy

305
00:22:23.270 --> 00:22:25.660
You will see an elevator dedicated to medical staff

306
00:22:29.620 --> 00:22:31.900
[pharmacy room]

307
00:22:42.830 --> 00:22:43.790
Take that elevator

308
00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:46.680
Go up to the top floor and enter the door

309
00:22:54.200 --> 00:22:55.920
You can't come in here

310
00:22:57.820 --> 00:22:59.180
not there

311
00:22:59.180 --> 00:23:00.270
go out

312
00:23:03.940 --> 00:23:06.780
[Roof stairs]

313
00:23:14.180 --> 00:23:16.170
There is an escape ladder at the end of the corridor

314
00:23:16.170 --> 00:23:17.570
Go up there and hide on the top floor

315
00:23:17.570 --> 00:23:18.680
I'll call you again

316
00:23:19.810 --> 00:23:21.900
Get up and I'll take you to a place

317
00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:27.240
You won't refuse my kindness anymore, will you?

318
00:23:27.240 --> 00:23:28.890
Because you are admirable

319
00:23:58.200 --> 00:24:00.000
you finally found it

320
00:24:01.820 --> 00:24:03.330
Not hard to find, right?

321
00:24:24.570 --> 00:24:26.100
I'm so stupid

322
00:24:26.810 --> 00:24:29.710
Uniforms, cram school and midterm exams…

323
00:24:31.540 --> 00:24:34.550
These are all the means you use to make me surrender.

324
00:24:34.550 --> 00:24:36.300
I resisted stupidly

325
00:24:36.710 --> 00:24:38.220
what do you want from me

326
00:24:39.140 --> 00:24:40.580
I'm willing to do anything

327
00:24:41.820 --> 00:24:43.780
what do i want from you

328
00:24:43.780 --> 00:24:46.010
You need the settlement letter from my dad's medical lawsuit?

329
00:24:46.780 --> 00:24:47.770
I can…

330
00:24:47.770 --> 00:24:49.650
Get it for you

331
00:24:49.650 --> 00:24:51.110
But…

332
00:24:51.110 --> 00:24:52.530
You have to help me too

333
00:24:53.680 --> 00:24:54.960
Really?

334
00:24:58.890 --> 00:25:01.090
But reconciliation…

335
00:25:01.090 --> 00:25:03.150
It's what I least want

336
00:25:07.340 --> 00:25:09.080
What do you want, Seulgi?

337
00:25:10.800 --> 00:25:12.380
I want to live a stable life

338
00:25:15.390 --> 00:25:17.290
Jay, you won’t understand

339
00:25:18.070 --> 00:25:21.030
I have been bullied and trampled on

340
00:25:21.030 --> 00:25:22.990
How did you survive?

341
00:25:23.990 --> 00:25:26.310
If you want to survive, you can only study

342
00:25:27.680 --> 00:25:30.520
Studying is the only way to protect me

343
00:25:30.520 --> 00:25:31.800
Is my only protective umbrella

344
00:25:36.790 --> 00:25:39.970
So please make sure that my physical examination results are okay.

345
00:25:41.360 --> 00:25:43.210
I must be admitted to the Department of Medicine of Korea University

346
00:25:54.780 --> 00:25:56.430
Live your life peacefully...

347
00:26:06.070 --> 00:26:07.760
I've been helping you

348
00:26:08.470 --> 00:26:10.200
It's the same now, isn't it?

349
00:26:18.650 --> 00:26:20.540
Let’s celebrate today first

350
00:26:21.600 --> 00:26:25.680
You might think that just by taking medicine
You can get the first place in Caihua Girls' High School

351
00:26:25.680 --> 00:26:26.780
but not like that

352
00:26:27.520 --> 00:26:29.620
That’s why I won’t sell you medicine

353
00:26:30.590 --> 00:26:31.920
Yu Seqi

354
00:26:31.920 --> 00:26:33.080
Liu Jieyi

355
00:26:33.080 --> 00:26:35.320
See our names tied for the top spot

356
00:26:35.600 --> 00:26:36.990
It feels so exciting

357
00:26:37.980 --> 00:26:40.000
If it had been anyone else, I would have been very unhappy

358
00:26:40.000 --> 00:26:41.210
But because it’s you…

359
00:26:42.250 --> 00:26:43.430
I'm very happy

360
00:26:48.400 --> 00:26:50.060
Then keep your promise and answer me

361
00:26:52.400 --> 00:26:54.360
Why don't you answer me?

362
00:26:54.360 --> 00:26:56.490
If this midterm exam

363
00:26:56.490 --> 00:26:58.740
If you do better than me, I'll tell you

364
00:26:58.740 --> 00:27:01.760
How did I get your basic information?

365
00:27:01.760 --> 00:27:03.370
And why should we get it?

